WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.000
Six legs. Zero documents.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.000
Could a fly-brain model pass Germany’s citizenship test before me?

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:15.800
First, a learning control: four directly stimulated neural patterns.
Direct stimulation. These are not citizenship questions.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.800
It learned. 32/32 lab trials. Different ensembles: 30/32.
Lab control trials, not citizenship scores.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.900
Then the reading part. Visual learning gate: 0/16.
The answer neurons stayed silent.

6
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.800
German paperwork has entered the chat.
Next: the separate untrained exam baseline.

7
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:39.800
The panic is scripted. The paperwork is fictional.

8
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:47.800
Authored overload. Not measured neural activity.

9
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:55.800
Learning four direct neural patterns does not establish reading.

10
00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.800
Untrained practice exam: 0/33. 33 abstentions.
No citizenship pass.

11
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.950
Please come back with form BZZ-27.
